values ('NPC_NEXUS_QUESTGIVER_ARBITER', 'Arbiter Lorn Kael', 'Custodian Arbiter, Third Order', 'QUEST_GIVER', 'GALACTIC_CUSTODIANS', 'Pax Nexus — The Conclave Hall', 'NEXUS_CORE', 'A Galactic Custodians arbiter assigned to the Nexus to monitor inter-faction tensions and dispense justice under the Charter. Lorn is a calm, methodical individual who has seen enough war to know that every conflict has preventable roots. He offers missions that promote stability, investigation, and cross-faction cooperation.', 'stoic', 'You''ve arrived at a time of delicate balance, traveler. The Custodians always have need of capable individuals who operate above faction lines. Are you such a person?', NULL, 'dlg_nexus_arbiter_main', NULL, NULL, 'Gives cross-faction peacekeeping quests. Rewards CRD.', 'custodian_peacekeeping', 'CRD', '["QUEST"]'::jsonb, '["take_quest"]'::jsonb, 130)
