values ('NPC_NEXUS_TRADER_SABLE', 'Sable Rythe', 'Purveyor of Unusual Goods', 'MERCHANT', 'NEUTRAL', 'Pax Nexus — The Shadow Bazaar', 'NEXUS_CORE', 'Sable operates in the legal grey zone. Their wares are technically not contraband — the Custodians have checked, repeatedly — but they always seem to have exactly what you didn''t know you needed. Rare materials, faction-specific items that shouldn''t be sold outside their territory, and items that appear in the ledger as ''miscellaneous recoveries.'' Sable never asks where things came from.', 'mysterious', 'Looking for something, friend? I have a feeling I know what it is. That''s my gift. Well, one of them. Everything here is perfectly legal, I assure you. The Arbiter checked last Tuesday.', 'shop_nexus_sable', 'dlg_nexus_sable_main', 'CRD', NULL, 'Sells rare/cross-faction materials. Player can also SELL items here for CRD (unique — most neutral NPCs pay faction currency on sell, but Sable pays CRD directly at lower rate).', NULL, NULL, '["BUY", "SELL"]'::jsonb, '["open_shop"]'::jsonb, 136)
