values ('NPC_NEXUS_QUESTGIVER_SMUGGLER', 'Revan ''Ghost'' Mox', 'Free Agent (Self-Declared)', 'QUEST_GIVER', 'NEUTRAL', 'Pax Nexus — The Shadow Bazaar (back corner)', 'NEXUS_CORE', 'Ghost is an infamous freelancer who sells information and contracts to anyone who can pay. He has no faction loyalty but seems to know every faction''s secrets. His quests are morally ambiguous but always lucrative. The Arbiter watches him closely, but Ghost has never technically broken the Charter. He lives in the technical spaces between the rules.', 'cunning', 'Ah, a fresh face. And by the look of you, a capable one. I have work that pays well, asks no inconvenient questions, and officially never happened. Sound like your kind of business?', NULL, 'dlg_nexus_ghost_main', NULL, NULL, 'Gives morally grey quests — stealth ops, intelligence gathering, material ''recovery''. Very high CRD rewards but occasional reputation consequences with Custodians.', 'shadow_contracts', 'CRD', '["QUEST"]'::jsonb, '["take_quest"]'::jsonb, 138)
